  "id": "in-another-room",
  "title": "In Another Room",
  "subtitle": "A serialized horror limited series. Eight rooms. One haunted house.",
  "description": "In Another Room is a narrative horror podcast and limited audio drama series — eight episodes set inside one of LA's most notoriously haunted homes, where every room contains a different ghost story and every story is connected. Amateur paranormal investigator Wendy Morrow has spent years researching the house. Tonight she finally has the keys. What begins as a routine overnight investigation becomes a descent through decades of tragedy — from the mansion's troubled construction in 1873 to the present day — as Wendy moves room by room through the dark, following the voices of the dead toward a truth she was never meant to find. Adapted from E3W Productions' critically acclaimed immersive theatre show. A serialized horror limited series in eight parts. A Violet Hour Media production. LISTENER WARNING: This program includes depictions of violence, domestic abuse, and other subject matter that may be upsetting for some listeners. Popular Topics Include: narrative horror podcast, haunted house podcast, ghost story podcast, horror fiction podcast, serialized horror audio drama, atmospheric horror podcast, paranormal investigation horror, period ghost story, immersive horror audio, horror podcast like The Magnus Archives, horror podcast like Archive 81, horror podcast like Limetown, horror podcast like The Lovecraft Investigations, horror podcast like Old Gods of Appalachia, Wendy Morrow, Violet Hour Media, haunted mansion horror, connected ghost stories, limited series horror podcast.",
